<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stanhome said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stanhome said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Legg Mason downgraded Stanhome Inc to hold from outperform, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- reduced the earnings estimates to $2.10 per share from $2.17 for 1996, and to $2.35 from $2.65 for 1997, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/4 to 26-1/2.</p>
</text>
